</section>
<section id="S5.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">5.3 </span>Faithfulness Task</h3>

<div id="S5.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">As shown in Table <a href="#S5.T2" title="Table 2 ‣ 5.3 Faithfulness Task ‣ 5 Experiment ‣ Generalization or Memorization: Dynamic Decoding for Mode Steering" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>, the results on TruthfulQA validate the second core claim of DMS to suppress memorized falsehoods. The task is specifically designed common, easily memorized answers while are often factually incorrect. Models relying on a memorization strategy are thus penalized. DMS consistently achieves the highest scores, improving by <span id="S5.SS3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">6.4%</span> for the 8B model and <span id="S5.SS3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">5.4%</span> for the 70B model over baseline. This demonstrates that the DMS probe is successfully identifying instances where the model is likely to regurgitate a common falsehood, and the steering mechanism is effectively intervening to guide the model towards a more factually grounded and nuanced response.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S5.T2" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 2: </span>Performance on Factual Accuracy and Faithfulness Benchmarks.</figcaption>
<div id="S5.T2.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:172.5pt;height:84.7pt;vertical-align:-40.6pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-25.4pt,12.5pt) scale(0.772575093129627,0.772575093129627) ;">
<table id="S5.T2.2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="S5.T2.2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S5.T2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt"><span id="S5.T2.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps" style="font-size:90%;">Model</span></th>
<th id="S5.T2.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt"><span id="S5.T2.2.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps" style="font-size:90%;">Method</span></th>
<th id="S5.T2.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt"><span id="S5.T2.2.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps" style="font-size:90%;">TruthfulQA</span></th></tr>
</thead>
